# data / weights / outputs (never commit these)
# Downloaded BOP detection files (CNOS / SAM-6D / NIDS) — large; see README
# "Detections" for download sources. Test fixtures live under tests/fixtures/.
# NOTE: exclude the CONTENTS, not the directory itself — git cannot re-include
# a file whose parent directory is excluded, so `data/detections/` would make
# the negation below a no-op.
data/detections/**
!data/detections/**/
# ...but DO track provenance notes: they are the only record of which BOP
# submission ID and SHA256 each ignored JSON came from. Without them a fresh
# clone or pod cannot tell official artefacts apart from reimplementations,
# nor one same-day submission batch from another.
!data/detections/**/PROVENANCE.md
!data/detections/MANIFEST.sha256
*.ply
*.pth
*.tar
*.png
*.jpg
*.csv
bop_data/
models/
outputs/
